    "Qwen on a third-party gateway: a bare root-level enable_thinking, with no extra_body wrapper and no thinking_budget. Relays commonly reject both of those with a 400, so this is the safe choice for self-hosted vLLM/SGLang and OpenAI-compatible relays serving qwen models." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qwen on a third-party gateway: a bare root-level enable_thinking, with no extra_body wrapper and no thinking_budget. Relays commonly reject both of those with a 400, so this is the safe choice for self-hosted vLLM/SGLang and OpenAI-compatible relays serving qwen models."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qwen en una pasarela de terceros: solo enable_thinking en el nivel raíz, sin envoltorio extra_body ni thinking_budget. Los relays suelen rechazar ambos con un 400, así que esta es la opción segura para vLLM/SGLang autoalojados y para relays compatibles con OpenAI que sirven modelos qwen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第三方网关上的 Qwen：仅发送根级 enable_thinking，不带 extra_body 包装，也不发 thinking_budget。中转站通常会因这两个字段返回 400，因此自建 vLLM/SGLang 及提供 qwen 模型的 OpenAI 兼容中转站应选此项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qwen on a third-party gateway: enable_thinking and a token budget at the root only, with no extra_body wrapper. This is the safe choice for self-hosted vLLM/SGLang and OpenAI-compatible relays serving qwen models." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qwen on a third-party gateway: enable_thinking and a token budget at the root only, with no extra_body wrapper. This is the safe choice for self-hosted vLLM/SGLang and OpenAI-compatible relays serving qwen models."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qwen en una pasarela de terceros: enable_thinking y un presupuesto de tokens solo en la raíz, sin envoltorio extra_body. Esta es la opción segura para vLLM/SGLang autoalojados y para relays compatibles con OpenAI que sirven modelos qwen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第三方网关上的 Qwen：enable_thinking 与 token 预算仅发送在根级，不带 extra_body 包装。自建 vLLM/SGLang 以及提供 qwen 模型的 OpenAI 兼容中转站应选此项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qwen/DashScope: enable_thinking and a token budget, sent at the root and in extra_body. Use ONLY for DashScope itself — other gateways reject the unknown extra_body field with a 400." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qwen/DashScope: enable_thinking and a token budget, sent at the root and in extra_body. Use ONLY for DashScope itself — other gateways reject the unknown extra_body field with a 400."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qwen/DashScope: enable_thinking y un presupuesto de tokens, enviados en la raíz y en extra_body. Úsalo SOLO para DashScope; otras pasarelas rechazan el campo desconocido extra_body con un 400."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qwen/DashScope：enable_thinking 与 token 预算，同时发送在根级和 extra_body 中。仅用于 DashScope 官方 —— 其他网关会因无法识别 extra_body 字段而返回 400。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
