    "Backfilling pre-v2 history into v2's shared zone. Already-uploaded records stay on iCloud if you cancel.\n\nIf migration is stuck and retrying doesn't help, Reset Migration Progress clears the local progress so it can start over. Your iCloud data is not deleted." : {
      "localizations" : {
