            "value" : "Cada chat tiene sus propias carpetas de **workspace**, **attachments**, **offloads** y **browser**, que se borran al terminar la sesión."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chaque conversation a ses propres dossiers **workspace**, **attachments**, **offloads** et **browser** — effacés à la fin de la session."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "各会話に専用の **workspace**、**attachments**、**offloads**、**browser** フォルダ — セッション終了時に削除されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "각 대화마다 전용 **workspace**, **attachments**, **offloads**, **browser** 폴더 — 세션 종료 시 정리됩니다。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "У каждого чата есть собственные папки **рабочая область**, **вложения**, **offloads** и **браузер** — они очищаются по окончании сессии."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个会话独立拥有 **workspace**、**attachments**、**offloads**、**browser** 目录 — 会话结束时清理。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個會話獨立擁有 **workspace**、**attachments**、**offloads**、**browser** 目錄 — 會話結束時清理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each new backup is also copied to the selected folders — including servers connected in the Files app (SMB, WebDAV) and cloud providers. A folder that is offline is reported and skipped; the local copy is always kept." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each new backup is also copied to the selected folders — including servers connected in the Files app (SMB, WebDAV) and cloud providers. A folder that is offline is reported and skipped; the local copy is always kept."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada copia de seguridad nueva también se copia en las carpetas seleccionadas, incluidos los servidores conectados en la app Archivos (SMB, WebDAV) y los proveedores en la nube. Si una carpeta está sin conexión, se informa y se omite; la copia local siempre se conserva."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次新建备份都会同时复制到所选文件夹——包括在“文件”App 中连接的服务器（SMB、WebDAV）和各类云盘。离线的文件夹会被报告并跳过；本地副本始终保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each new backup is copied to the selected folders. A folder that is offline is reported and skipped; the local copy is always kept." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
