    "If this happened while writing a large file, the request likely died mid-generation rather than the network being down: the whole file is generated as tool arguments before the write starts. Ask for the file in smaller appended chunks, or have it generated by a short script instead." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If this happened while writing a large file, the request likely died mid-generation rather than the network being down: the whole file is generated as tool arguments before the write starts. Ask for the file in smaller appended chunks, or have it generated by a short script instead."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si esto ocurrió al escribir un archivo grande, lo más probable es que la solicitud se haya cortado durante la generación y no que la red estuviera caída: el archivo completo se genera como argumentos de la herramienta antes de que empiece la escritura. Pide el archivo en fragmentos más pequeños que se vayan añadiendo, o haz que lo genere un script corto."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果这发生在写入大文件时，多半不是网络断了，而是请求在生成过程中中断了：整个文件会先作为工具参数生成完，才开始写入。可以让它分成多次追加写入，或改为用一小段脚本来生成。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果這發生在寫入大檔案時，多半不是網路斷了，而是請求在生成過程中中斷了：整個檔案會先作為工具參數生成完，才開始寫入。可以讓它分成多次追加寫入，或改為用一小段指令稿來生成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iFlytek (Xunfei)" : {
      "comment" : "Voice provider name",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek (Xunfei)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iFlytek needs App ID and API Secret — enter them as \"appId;apiKey;apiSecret\" in the API Key field." : {
      "comment" : "Voice provider credential note",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek benötigt App-ID und API-Secret – gib sie als „appId;apiKey;apiSecret“ im Feld API-Schlüssel ein."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek needs App ID and API Secret — enter them as \"appId;apiKey;apiSecret\" in the API Key field."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek necesita el App ID y el API Secret: introdúcelos como \"appId;apiKey;apiSecret\" en el campo de clave de API."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek nécessite l’App ID et l’API Secret — saisis-les sous la forme « appId;apiKey;apiSecret » dans le champ Clé API."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek には App ID と API Secret が必要です — API キー欄に「appId;apiKey;apiSecret」の形式で入力してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek에는 App ID와 API Secret이 필요합니다 — API 키 필드에 \"appId;apiKey;apiSecret\" 형식으로 입력하세요."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek требует App ID и API Secret — введите их как «appId;apiKey;apiSecret» в поле ключа API."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "讯飞需要 App ID 和 API Secret — 请在 API Key 字段中以“appId;apiKey;apiSecret”的形式填写。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "訊飛需要 App ID 和 API Secret — 請在 API Key 欄位中以「appId;apiKey;apiSecret」的形式填寫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
